# Required for map tiles: CARTO puts an API-key watermark on all raster tiles
# without one. Get a free key at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey and copy
# this file to .env (which is gitignored — never commit the real key).
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=YOUR_KEY_HERE

# Optional: point the app at your cache worker instead of api.btcmap.org directly.
# The worker must implement the same /v4/places paths (see cache/worker.ts).
VITE_BTCMAP_API=https://api.btcmap.org

# Optional: override map tiles entirely. If you change the URL you MUST also
# change the attribution to whatever the new provider requires (see ATTRIBUTION.md).
# VITE_TILE_URL=https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# VITE_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=
